# Faerie Slumber Party (CR 608.2c): Bot1 controls no creature of their own. Bot2's lone Ornithopter returns to its owner's hand and
# that alone is enough for Bot1 to create two Faerie tokens; the tokens are Bot1's (the spell's controller), not Bot2's.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Faerie Slumber Party
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faerie Slumber Party.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Faerie Token; Faerie Token; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Sapphire
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot2.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Island; Ornithopter
LeftBattlefield = Black Lotus (tapped); Ornithopter
